     1548         do
     1549         on error undo move_block, leave move_block
     1550         :
     1551           if p-change-value > 0
     1552           then do:
     1553             for each buf_temp-diasize-handle
     1554             on error undo, next
     1555             :
     1556               assign
     1557                 v-object-handle = buf_temp-diasize-handle.handle-value
     1558               .
